  "registration": "The four-view board locks one Intermodal Transit Hub - Sculptural Steel Exoskeleton with 65 m by 100 m, three public levels; the narrow glazed gable is the front facade and the complete nave runs deep along the long axis, with a lower brick plinth beneath two longitudinal parabolic arches, twenty-four paired fan ribs connecting arch nodes to real perimeter shoes, roof glazing between ribs, and an unobstructed central entry and platform axis. The fixed landmark consumes that complete topology; LEGO fallback modules repeat only audited ordinary middle bays.",
